    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "\"An Eco-Friendly Tourism Trip Planner Driven by Z-Number Uncertainty\" models variable travel times and review counts using fuzzy reliability scores to generate sustainable itineraries across five cities. \"An interactive framework for personalised urban accessibility assessment\" provides a deployed mapping tool that recalculates accessibility scores instantly using customizable preferences for walking distances, substitute services, and essential amenities. \"The Geographic Moran Effect: Theory, Methods, and Interpretation\" introduces a two-step spatiotemporal factor framework adapting ecological theory to detect and decompose synchronous temporal variation across spatial entities driven by external forcing.",
